        "summary": "Get Document",
        "description": "Get document metadata from Qdrant.\nSECURITY FIX: tenant_id and workspace_id come from Claims ONLY, never from request.\nThis prevents IDOR (Insecure Direct Object Reference) / cross-tenant access.",
